  "description": "A romance about childhood friends, mutual pining, and physical chemistry comes first. \n\nLim Ji-u and Go Jae-jun have been inseparable friends since kindergarten. While they seem like ordinary friends to everyone else, Jae-jun has secretly harbored a crush on Ji-u for a long time. One day, Ji-u, who falls in love easily, confesses to Jae-jun that she has a crush on his older brother. Upon hearing this, Jae-jun makes a provocative proposal: \n\n'My brother likes unusual things and sexy women. I’ll teach you how to be his type.' \n\nThe two set off on a three-day trip to learn these 'unusual things,' where Ji-u discovers a side of Jae-jun she never could have imagined. 'It’s too big! Is this even human?!'\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14147645), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1561017531), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/crushs_brother), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000079913), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260509)",
